{"unit_id":"tag:0DV5:proof","translation":"注意，<MATH_0001>为投有限（profinite）拓扑（topological）群（group），见基本（Fundamental）群（Groups），定义<REF_0001>。左端的范畴（categories）在第<REF_0002>节定义。右端范畴（categories）所用记号取自基本（Fundamental）群（Groups），定义<REF_0003>，对于集合（sets）而言，以及定义<REF_0004>，对于阿贝尔群（abelian groups）而言。这解释了记号。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n断言(1)由引理<REF_0005>和基本（Fundamental）群（Groups），定理<REF_0006>得出。(2)和(3)立即由此得出，只须给底层的（层（sheaves）所取值的）集合（sets）赋予额外结构。例如，有限（finite）局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf），其值为阿贝尔群（abelian groups），定义于<MATH_0002>上，等同于有限（finite）局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets），即<MATH_0003>，连同映射（map）<MATH_0004>，满足通常的公理（axioms）。等价（equivalence）(1)将积（products）映到积（products），因此将<MATH_0005>映到加法（addition），定义于对应的有限（finite）<MATH_0006>-集合（set）上。由于<MATH_0007>-模（modules）等同于<MATH_0008>-集合（sets），带有相容的阿贝尔群（abelian group）结构，我们得到(2)。(3)以完全相同的方式证明。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"profinite","target_term":"投有限"},{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term"